<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish NTMA to auction 85 mln punts of 10-yr bonds.</title>
<headline>Irish NTMA to auction 85 mln punts of 10-yr bonds.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ireland's National Treasury Management Agency said on Thursday it would auction 85 million punts of 8.0 treasury bonds due 2006 on July 15.</p>
</text>
